    "lines": [
     "Sized for <b>33 MW</b> of servers: heat to reject ≈ 33 × PUE 1.55 = <b>51.3 MW</b> at peak.",
     "35 air-cooled chillers carry it; with spares, <b>36</b>. Placed: 36 on the roof, 0 in the yard.",
     "Each unit about 12.141 × 2.362 m, 2.896 m high, with 0.9–2.1 m to walls and 1.8–4.3 m between units (dashed in 3D).",
     "<span class=\"src\">Air-cooled chillers with free-cooling coils (air cooling): an air-cooled hall needs chilled water at about 13 °C or warmer (NREL for DOE FEMP, Best Practices Guide 2024, s. 5.2.1), and a dry cooler cannot cool water below the outdoor air (rated units leave it 3–11 K above), so chillers carry the full load in summer. Basis unit: Vertiv Liebert AFC FIZ135, 12.14 × 2.36 m, 2.90 m high, 1,489 kW at 35 °C ambient, 27.8 → 18.9 °C fluid, 30% glycol, with oversized free-cooling coils (Vertiv SL-71060 R09/24, \"Preliminary data\"; manufacturer claim). Chosen 29 Oct 2026 as the unit near…"
    ],
    "genLines": [
     "26 generator sets of about 2 MW carry 51.3 MW; with spares, <b>27</b>. Placed: 0 on the roof, 27 in the yard.",
     "Each about 13.493 × 3.488 m, 4.777 m high; 1.5 m from the building, 2 m between sets (assumed from the 1 m service clearance).",
     "<span class=\"src\">Standby diesel generator sets in Sound Level 2 enclosures with sub-base tanks. Basis units: Rehlko (Kohler) KD2000, 2,000 kW standby (data-centre continuous rating the same), 13.49 × 3.49 m, up to 4.78 m high (G5-626, rev 6/24); KD1000, 1,000 kW, 8.43 × 2.62 m, 3.71 m high with the 12 h tank (G6-154, 12/23). Both EPA Tier 2, cULus (UL 2200, CSA C22.2 No. 100); manufacturer claims. Chosen 29 Oct 2026 as the middle of Cat, Rehlko and Generac: 2 MW 18.5–38.4 m² per MW, 1 MW 19.5–22.4. 1 m clear around each set (Cummins application manual; not checked ?); 1.5 m from wall openings…"
